  "question": {
    "text": "Four identical thin, square metal sheets, $S_1, S_2, S_3$ and $S_4$, each of side $a$ are kept parallel to each other with equal distance $d(\\ll a)$ between them, as shown in the figure. Let $C_0=\\varepsilon_0 a^2 / d$, where $\\varepsilon_0$ is the permittivity of free space.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/wrVTJvFmbkH-cpCDFPq8t7MWcliNkKMHSUGq3QODPwI.original.fullsize.png\">\nMatch the quantities mentioned in List-I with their values in List-II and choose the correct option.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/G0RPj7Bb_okyw7CrMC7Lv-b191S6Emkx_BZg-tF6d-w.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Jnbp4",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{P} \\rightarrow 3 ; \\mathrm{Q} \\rightarrow 2 ; \\mathrm{R} \\rightarrow 4 ; \\mathrm{S} \\rightarrow 5$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ot0N1",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{P} \\rightarrow 2 ; \\mathrm{Q} \\rightarrow 3 ; \\mathrm{R} \\rightarrow 2 ; \\mathrm{S} \\rightarrow 1$",
