  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For P\r\n<img src=\"images/hf8c375_chfcr47r348.png\">\r\nAll are in series\r\n\\(\\begin{gathered}\r\nC_{e q}=\\frac{C_0}{3} \\\\\r\nP \\rightarrow(3)\r\n\\end{gathered}\\)\r\nFor Q\r\n<img src=\"images/hf8c375_chfcr47r3481.png\">\r\n\\(\\begin{gathered}\r\nC_{e q}=\\frac{C_0}{2} \\\\\r\nQ \\rightarrow(2)\r\n\\end{gathered}\\)\r\nFor R\r\n<img src=\"images/hf8c375_chfcr47r3482.png\">\r\n\\(\\begin{gathered}\r\nC_{e q}=\\frac{2 C}{3} \\\\\r\nR \\rightarrow(4)\r\n\\end{gathered}\\)\r\nFor S\r\n<img src=\"images/hf8c375_chfcr47r3483.png\">\r\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\r\n& \\Rightarrow C_{e q}=3 C_0 \\\\\r\n& S \\rightarrow(1)\r\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
    "image": null
  },
